  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr George",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr George.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr John George is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 71 070 158 655) (MED0001169880) consulting at Sans Souci Doctors.",
      "Dr George graduated from Sudan in 1983, worked in different parts in East Africa as a medical practitioner. He developed an interest in infectious diseases prevention and control. He was selected for further training at the University of California, Berkley, USA, in the areas of communicable, epidemiology and childhood diseases.",
      "He moved to Australia 1991, he continued his interest in primary health care and health promotion. Lately he has followed interests in Diabetes and Asthma management. Dr George interested in teaching, medical students (Notre Dame University) and GP registrars.",
      "In addition to English, Dr George also speaks fluent Arabic."
    ]
  },
