    "source_note": "Dr John George has closed his books and is **not accepting new patients**. All existing patients will be privately charged on an ongoing basis. **Bulk Billing** is strictly restricted to routine consultations for existing patients who are: - Children aged 15 and under - Seniors aged 65 and over - Concession Card holders - DVA Card holders"
